#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニタ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いまは校章が浮かんでいるだけだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. きっと今も、この向こうで黒幕が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even now...on the other side of this camera, the\n"
"mastermind...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、それももうすぐ終わりだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But that's gonna come to an end soon enough!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>女子更衣室に入るのは…
#. やっぱり…ちょっと…マズいよな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Going in the girls locker room...just...isn't a good\n"
"idea, is it?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こっちは男子更衣室のカードリーダーだ。
#. ボクの電子生徒手帳で開けられるはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The boys locker room card reader. I can open it using\n"
"my e-Handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>部屋のロックは解除されてるみたいだけど…
#. 女子更衣室に入るのは…ちょっと…マズいよな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The girls locker room has been unlocked. But going\n"
"in...probably isn't a good idea, is it?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって…本物の銃だよな？
#. なんでこんなものがあるんだよ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is that...a real gun? Why is there something like that\n"
"here...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この棚には…
#. 水泳用の色々な用具が並んでいる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are a bunch of different pool-related items on\n"
"the shelf.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>浮き輪がある…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A flotation donut...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Một cái phao bơi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. はい
msgctxt "0011 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0012 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"
